{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/999680-aliens-in-the-world-of-darkness","id":999680,"title":"Aliens in the World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-07T05:38:02-08:00","id":999680,"title":"Aliens in the World of Darkness","content":"Does anyone know of any canonical information about aliens in the World of Darkness (or Chronicles of Darkness, for that matter)? Mage: the Ascension First Edition contained an alien race called the Ka Luon, who were sort of like the Greys from UFO lore, but I have never seen anything else about of them in other Mage books. Is there any other information out there? Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T07:11:14-08:00","id":999723,"title":"","content":"Short answer: The Book of Worlds","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T07:19:59-08:00","id":999727,"title":"","content":"As of the Revised era, the Ka Luon are s